{"job_id":"F-5562d6153a2e2d27dd30","family_id":"F-5562d6153a2e2d27dd30","title":"육군인사사령부령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"e75b8d3b17cd2fe0fc9c28d4d6be0484362182063f22d248f393785431d6d996","source_hash":"a8b75666c34c06b1b749a8ce35897b50983d62a3a8a20c07c319445c99d1a2b9","text":"陆军人事指挥令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":112,"target_id":"c9a19d0541de84f4118595b05c29e18ecb14070d3562eb24edd1e83438b5c842","source_hash":"24414c970ae9bc2b42d11edd06ae8573b04063186c7887cca88f6cdbb0439f7b","text":"第一条（设立及职责）陆军人事司令部设立于陆军内部，负责监督人事事务，包括人员招募、人事管理、人事行政以及对退伍士兵的支持。<2010年10月13日修订；2014年7月16日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":112,"end":334,"target_id":"e5d8bef95ca8f948b5feba08055eac8b46ed30ce6f44e752969ca23b0f0f32d3","source_hash":"6315e95f29f112ba728836245b2c72c33aa6c1afc83df57020f24ff09fe41419","text":"第二条（指挥官等）\n① 陆军人事司令部（以下简称“人事司令部”）设司令员一名，副司令员一名。\n② 司令官和副司令官应从陆军将官中任命。<2017年9月5日修订>\n司令官在陆军参谋长的命令下，负责监督人事司令部的运作，并指挥和监督参谋部门和附属单位。\n副指挥官协助指挥官，并在指挥官因不可避免的情况无法履行职责时代表指挥官行事。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":334,"end":492,"target_id":"63a9a3a48f70c58530165416b1d1970a0b399567e569b451ffdc8aaa314fd12e","source_hash":"cfc8cc5be5829f699fa192e14a93c43177b6f436f9c69463ad4471c10c26bf95","text":"第三条（设立参谋部门和附属单位）\n① 人事司令部应当设有履行第一条所规定职责所需的单位和参谋部门。\n② 根据第1款规定设立部队的职责、任务和组织事项，由国防部长决定；设立参谋部门和职责划分事项，由陆军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":492,"end":537,"target_id":"71988503b81ad3be098fb596a043cb1c336924fcfd412fe4449ea092b2264300","source_hash":"18a7934a8af46700f38c528795a0365c2bcc195856a55a3e026ac7bda480353c","text":"第四条（人员配额）分配到人事司令部的军事人员和文职人员的人员配额，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":537,"end":588,"target_id":"81362236d208061b886aea8ef73b24418fe9de095451772e095ce6c8fc9ab4af","source_hash":"38b6a34e93a695452427fb3e4b20c7afc2a8165e36cb847a0923ad9e91bddf8d","text":"补充规定 <第19220号，2005年12月30日>\n\n本法令自2006年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":588,"end":622,"target_id":"468f53903faff853ada34388cdc08086ca2932221033c7c5ae59bb767f759fd7","source_hash":"13cca49f2c309c2473b4819147129708a52dbb5b4b7782731cd3203ae10bf5e2","text":"增补（陆军总部组织结构）<第22434号，2010年10月13日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":622,"end":651,"target_id":"8e6b24639656541f5f861d757d8152e41d853e17b65cf2d41aa268231547ffe5","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":651,"end":693,"target_id":"bf52e2f33bf2d23c01938307a6455b69e512594f83183d79928d024e61c63fc7","source_hash":"69e489fc5abc077b0e92bd2a1b690107d27fdba75edb3d19a67756eef08c8a43","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）对陆军人事司令部法令的部分内容修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":693,"end":751,"target_id":"79f1cef483b1b9d0d550b22cce102c6a4fe113b7a6612e8a69e550ef8a8a8c29","source_hash":"6bf7756b150f62e9935fbbfd41e418302be5d2bbc3d74aa2f14723a35fea9245","text":"  第 1 条中的“人事运作、人事管理、医疗卫生”应改为“人事运作、人事管理、退伍士兵支持”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":751,"end":795,"target_id":"a9cb25e48eb57a3fcb101951ce6b220696f06675c071bd5bde6d8d719af88f55","source_hash":"9b1a634a844e9ea3a0ca9122454c76734130481fec94fe78afa6f4d3e49cc094","text":"补充规定 <第25465号，2014年7月16日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":795,"end":828,"target_id":"2741a7551e6f09b9211cadc7947846e62783a64544f655327ded8cb5a4d812fb","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":828,"end":865,"target_id":"5e30b1f2d945e875612716c552bd50495672f22d73f90dec7cad2661355b927a","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":865,"end":879,"target_id":"4b76bbe48889b7f402f1ccac1d0291e9383b3b7c6f9af57f2f7197b4c0005fe1","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010099-197283-ko","scope":"BODY","start":879,"end":997,"target_id":"38ed7f66bc9a535062c43d7a27ce5d734b741cc36d6535b48b7ac58148155209","source_hash":"eeba024f6ec7d48705019e12fb1ff49a436e9f193f95773bb2304399bf01138e","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<63>款省略\n\n  <64> 陆军人事司令部法令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第 2 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <65> 至 <90> 已省略"}]}